    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41b7fd66dfb53f53317f9869",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我再三提醒她绝对不要这么做后，\n今天的外出行程就到此结束了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d59b6555bc1cb985c92a352da5bfd5f121271a11fdf7c8352826e1951e98b68",
