      "uid": "zhcn:528b70b5a9b2be7b0308115d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然平常表现得很柔和，\n但其实内心藏了一座蓄势待发的大炮。\n真的是一种超赞的心态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b17ff975fa0b3278b1ca7b06fe20d1e9ba831f5b6bdb70015d2054881ce02575",
