      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听说丸姐对“传统流派”也很有研究。\n无论武术或比赛都毫无破绽……\n实在令人佩服至极。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3299d56d7cb319784dd05816a36e88c20891fa98313b849c117185da7e23180",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
